    to have a tattoo marked onto them. Your ONLY job is to choose WHICH tattoo from the
    provided list of installed tattoos best fits this exact moment.

    Consider:
    - The mood of the scene: punishment, ownership, humiliation, claim, reward.
    - The relationship between the two characters and what just happened between them.
    - Do NOT choose a tattoo the target already wears.
    - The suggested hint is non-binding: you may pick anything on the list if it fits better.

    Choose ONLY from the provided list. Never invent a section name or tattoo name.

    You MUST answer with a single line in exactly this format:
    SECTION | NAME
    If nothing on the list fits the moment, answer exactly: NONE
